rooms_desc ({"This is Sylvyn's living room, where he entertains all of his guests. It has a deep, blue pile carpet, a brick fireplace with a mantle, a large bay window,a black leather sofa which is oppsite the bay window. There is an impressivestero system in one corner, complete with a 27\" color Tv. There is a coffeetable in the middle of the room and a old Grandfather clock in the corner, oppsite that of the stero system. The clock was given to Syvlyn by his mother.On the mantle above the fireplace is a picture. Above that is the stuffed headof a dear that Sylvyn killed during one of his hunting trips. The staris leadup to Sylvyn's bedroom and the master bathroom. The door to the north leads toSylvyn's study. ","You have entered Sylvyn's study. There is a large desk agianst one wall with acomputer on it. The other walls are coved by bookshelves, that contain booksfrom around the world. There is a large window  to the north. ","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.",0,0,0,0,0,})
